# Hardware Design

This folder contains the hardware design files of the CAN-Based Network Traffic Management System.

## Hardware Components

- TI C2000 Microcontroller (External LaunchPad)
- MCP2515 CAN Controller
- MCP2562FD CAN Transceiver
- CAN Bus Interface
- Crystal Oscillator Circuit
- Power Supply Circuit
- CAN Termination Circuit
- Status Indicators

## Design Files

- Circuit Schematic
- PCB Layout
- Bill of Materials (BOM)
- Component Datasheets
- PCB Fabrication Files (Gerber)

## Design Tool

KiCad – Electronic Design Automation (EDA)
